# wip335: the CHOKE group is kept by the autosave (not only by a saved preset): set it, wait, power off / on, it is back
autosave 1
# wip437: the factory defaults are now AUTOSAVE OFF and OUTPUT LOUD; this scenario was written for the old ones
wait 300
tap EDIT
expect view 14
key b10 down
turn K2 1 80
wait 100
key b10 up
wait 200
expect choke 1
turn ALGO 1 80
tapkey b3
wait 200
expect choke 9
wait 6000
reboot
wait 500
expect choke 9
tap EDIT
key b10 down
turn K2 -1 80
wait 100
key b10 up
wait 200
expect choke 8
